{"type":"page","html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\" data-next-head=\"\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\" data-next-head=\"\"/><title data-next-head=\"\"></title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A curated selection of web projects showcasing modern frontend development, performance-focused builds, animation-driven interfaces, and real-world client solutions.\" data-next-head=\"\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab57efd000576a30-s.p.37015d44.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-next-font=\"size-adjust\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/8c2eb9ceedecfc8e-s.p.21935807.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-next-font=\"size-adjust\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/72391b5c032a8922.css\" as=\"style\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/72391b5c032a8922.css\" data-n-g=\"\"/><noscript data-n-css=\"\"></noscript><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/c9d5e6ff240f2914.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/8dddedb1c7984f6b.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/67d3680bc4df0ae0.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/10f308c3aff31654.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-71a9e0843b48be4d.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/94b612f9c1bad969.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-7d9e2b56ac89e87a.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/7H5uEZWCXuV17zlzY-Nu9/_ssgManifest.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/7H5uEZWCXuV17zlzY-Nu9/_buildManifest.js\" defer=\"\"></script></head><body><div id=\"__next\"><div class=\"inter_tight_e23789dc-module__F1lucG__variable lora_8c06ef97-module__MhB2kG__variable antialiased\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-row flex-col font-inter mx-auto relative xl:py-[4.25rem] xl:px-[6.75rem] md:p-[3.75rem] p-[1.5rem]\"><nav class=\"xl:pr-[3.25rem] md:pr-[1.75rem] md:border-none md:pb-0 md:mb-0 mb-[1.5rem] pb-[1rem] border-b border-[#D3D3D3] side-nav\"><ul class=\"flex md:flex-col flex-row md:justify-start justify-end gap-[1rem] md:gap-0 text-right font-[lora-sans]\"><li class=\"text-[1.15rem]\"><a class=\"transition-[color] duration-[350ms] \n              text-[#808080]\" href=\"/\">about</a></li><li class=\"text-[1.15rem]\"><a class=\"transition-[color] duration-[350ms] \n              text-[#808080]\" href=\"/resume\">resume</a></li><li class=\"text-[1.15rem]\"><a class=\"transition-[color] duration-[350ms] \n              text-[#000] hover:text-[#000]\" href=\"/projects\">projects</a></li><li class=\"text-[1.15rem]\"><a class=\"transition-[color] duration-[350ms] \n              text-[#808080]\" href=\"/thoughts\">thoughts</a></li></ul></nav><main class=\"max-w-2xl w-full md:border-l md:border-[#D3D3D3] xl:pl-[3.25rem] md:pl-[1.75rem]\"><section class=\"md-content\"><div><h1>Notable Projects</h1>\n<h2>Commercial Projects</h2>\n<p>A selection of web projects led or collaboratively delivered while working with digital agencies.</p>\n<div class=\"unstyled-list\">\n<ul>\n<li>001 <a href=\"https://blakegriffin.com/\">Blake Griffin</a></li>\n<li>002 <a href=\"https://www.braums.com/\">Braum's</a></li>\n<li>003 <a href=\"https://www.thebankofbennington.com/\">Bank of Bennington</a></li>\n<li>004 <a href=\"https://globalrefuge.org\">Global Refuge</a></li>\n<li>005 <a href=\"https://fnb-usda-map.liquidfish.com/\">FNB Loan Eligibility Map</a></li>\n<li>006 <a href=\"https://sod-calculator.liquidfish.com/\">Maddison Square Turf Sod Calculator</a></li>\n<li>007 <a href=\"https://venturetrailers.com\">Venture Trailers</a></li>\n<li>008 <a href=\"https://creditxpert.com\">Credit Xpert</a></li>\n<li>009 <a href=\"https://charmcityscreenprint.com/\">Charm City Screen Print</a></li>\n<li>010 <a href=\"https://cc-md.org\">Catholic Charities</a></li>\n<li>011 <a href=\"https://squierinc.com/\">Squier Inc.</a></li>\n<li>012 <a href=\"https://markcg.com/\">Mark Construction</a></li>\n<li>013 <a href=\"https://fisherarchitecture.com/\">Fisher Architecture</a></li>\n<li>014 <a href=\"https://dragonboatsbaltimore.org/\">Dragon Boat Races Baltimore</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n<h2>Personal Projects</h2>\n<h3>01 Accommodation Booking Web Platform</h3>\n<p>An accommodation booking platform built using Laravel Inertia and PayMongo checkout.</p>\n<p>Stack: Laravel, InertiaJS, Vue, SCSS, MySQL</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"foot-links\"> \n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/kenkozma17/libot-accommodation-bookings\">Github</a> <a href=\"https://booking.catmidinn.com/\">Website</a></p>\n</div>\n<h3>02 My Portfolio Website (2026)</h3>\n<p>My brand new portfolio website running on Cloudflare Pages that parses MD files for most of the pages.</p>\n<p>Stack: Next.js, Markdown, Cloudflare Pages, SSG</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"foot-links\"> \n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/kenkozma17/kenkozma.dev\">Github</a></p>\n</div>\n<h3>03 CocoMS</h3>\n<p>A CMS built on Statamic intended to deliver websites quicker.</p>\n<p>Stack: Laravel, PHP, Statamic</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"foot-links\"> \n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/kenkozma17/cocomanagement\">Github</a></p>\n</div>\n<h3>04 Patient Management System</h3>\n<p>A patient management platform built for a small lab clinic to automate patient onboarding.</p>\n<p>Stack: Laravel, InertiaJS, Vue, JavaScript, MySQL</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"foot-links\"> \n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/kenkozma17/libot-patient-management\">Github</a></p>\n</div>\n<h3>05 Baller Directory</h3>\n<p>A directory to help coaches rate and reference football players in the Philippines.</p>\n<p>Stack: Laravel, InertiaJS, Vue, SCSS, MySQL</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"foot-links\"> \n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/kenkozma17/footballer-directory\">Github</a></p>\n</div></div></section></main></div></div></div><script id=\"__NEXT_DATA__\" type=\"application/json\">{\"props